<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PIZZOO | Premium Pizza | Bhandup West, Mumbai</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lato:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

<style>
:root {
  --red: #C8102E;
  --gold: #F0A500;
  --dark: #0f0a05;
  --dark2: #1a1008;
  --cream: #FFF8F0;
  --brown: #3D1F00;
  --white: #ffffff;
  --gray: #888;
}

* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
  background: var(--dark);
  color: var(--white);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

/* ===== INTRO ANIMATION ===== */
#intro-screen {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9999;
  background: #0a0500;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  gap: 0;
  transition: opacity 1s ease, visibility 1s;
  overflow: hidden;
}
#intro-screen.hide { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none; }

/* Ambient background glow */
#intro-screen::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 600px; height: 300px;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom, rgba(255,80,0,0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
  animation: ambientPulse 2s infinite alternate;
}
@keyframes ambientPulse {
  from { opacity: 0.6; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

/* ---- OVEN SVG SCENE ---- */
.intro-scene {
  position: relative;
  width: 360px;
  height: 320px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* The SVG oven sits in the scene */
#oven-svg {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 360px;
  height: 260px;
}

/* Pizza SVG slides out from oven opening */
#pizza-svg {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 82px;
  left: 50%;
  width: 160px;
  height: 160px;
  transform: translateX(-50%) translateX(-200px) scale(0.4);
  opacity: 0;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 40px rgba(255,120,0,0.85));
  z-index: 20;
  animation: pizzaSlideOut 1.4s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) 1.8s forwards;
}
@keyframes pizzaSlideOut {
  0%   { transform: translateX(-50%) translateX(-200px) scale(0.4); opacity: 0; }
  20%  { opacity: 1; }
  60%  { transform: translateX(-50%) translateX(0px) scale(1.08); opacity: 1; }
  80%  { transform: translateX(-50%) translateX(6px) scale(1.04); }
  100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateX(0px) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
}

/* Heat shimmer lines */
.steam-line {
  position: absolute;
  width: 3px; border-radius: 3px;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(255,160,60,0.5), transparent);
  animation: steamRise 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  opacity: 0;
}
.steam-line:nth-child(1) { left: 130px; bottom: 240px; height: 50px; animation-delay: 0.1s; }
.steam-line:nth-child(2) { left: 160px; bottom: 240px; height: 70px; animation-delay: 0.4s; }
.steam-line:nth-child(3) { left: 190px; bottom: 240px; height: 45px; animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.steam-line:nth-child(4) { left: 220px; bottom: 240px; height: 60px; animation-delay: 0.6s; }
@keyframes steamRise {
  0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0) scaleX(1); }
  30%  { opacity: 0.8; }
  100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-50px) scaleX(0.3); }
}

/* Logo reveals after pizza is out */
.intro-logo {
  opacity: 0;
  text-align: center;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-top: 12px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 30;
  animation: logoReveal 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 3.4s both;
}
@keyframes logoReveal {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px) scale(0.88); filter: blur(8px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1);        filter: blur(0px); }
}
.intro-logo img {
  height: 130px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  /* Remove white background from logo PNG */
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 28px rgba(240,165,0,0.8)) drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255,120,0,0.5)) brightness(1.1) contrast(1.05);
}
.intro-tagline {
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.45em;
  color: var(--gold);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  opacity: 0;
  animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease 4.1s forwards;
}
@keyframes fadeUp {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* Oven glow pulses when pizza comes out */
#oven-glow {
  animation: ovenGlowPop 0.6s ease 1.7s both;
}
@keyframes ovenGlowPop {
  0%   { opacity: 0.4; }
  50%  { opacity: 1; }
  100% { opacity: 0.6; }
}

/* ===== NAV ===== */
nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 1000;
  padding: 0 30px;
  background: rgba(10,6,2,0.95);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.15);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  height: 70px;
}
.nav-logo img { height: 50px; mix-blend-mode: multiply; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(240,165,0,0.4)) brightness(1.02); }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 40px; list-style: none; }
.nav-links a {
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
  font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: color 0.3s;
  position: relative;
}
.nav-links a::after {
  content:''; position: absolute; bottom: -4px; left: 0; width: 0; height: 2px;
  background: var(--gold); transition: width 0.3s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

.nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
.cart-btn {
  position: relative; background: none; border: none; color: white; cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 22px; padding: 6px;
}
.cart-badge {
  position: absolute; top: -2px; right: -6px;
  background: var(--red); color: white; font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 900; min-width: 18px; height: 18px;
  border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
}
.wa-btn {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366, #128C7E);
  color: white; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 50px;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
  font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(37,211,102,0.3);
}
.wa-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(37,211,102,0.5); }

.hamburger { display: none; background: none; border: none; color: white; font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; }

/* ===== HERO ===== */
#home {
  height: 100vh; position: relative;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-bg {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513104890138-7c749659a591?w=1600') center/cover no-repeat;
}
.hero-overlay {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10,6,2,0.92) 40%, rgba(10,6,2,0.6) 100%);
}
.hero-content {
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
  max-width: 900px; text-align: center; padding: 20px;
}
.hero-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  background: rgba(240,165,0,0.15);
  border: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.4);
  color: var(--gold); padding: 6px 20px;
  border-radius: 50px;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  animation: fadeInDown 0.8s ease 6.2s both;
}
.hero-logo {
  height: 160px; margin-bottom: 24px;
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(240,165,0,0.6)) brightness(1.08) contrast(1.05);
  animation: heroLogo 1s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 6.4s both;
}
@keyframes heroLogo {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8) translateY(20px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
}
@keyframes fadeInDown {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-15px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.hero-h1 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  animation: fadeUp2 1s ease 6.6s both;
}
.hero-h1 span { color: var(--gold); }
@keyframes fadeUp2 {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.hero-sub {
  font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em; line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
  animation: fadeUp2 1s ease 6.9s both;
}
.hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
  animation: fadeUp2 1s ease 7.1s both;
}
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--red); color: white;
  padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: all 0.3s;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(200,16,46,0.4);
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: #a00e26; transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(200,16,46,0.6); }
.btn-outline {
  background: transparent; color: white;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: all 0.3s;
}
.btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-3px); }

.scroll-hint {
  position: absolute; bottom: 30px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  text-align: center; z-index: 2;
  animation: bounce 2s infinite;
  opacity: 0.5;
}
.scroll-hint span { display: block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; }
@keyframes bounce { 0%,100%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(8px)} }

/* ===== STATS BANNER ===== */
.stats-banner {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), #8b0000, var(--red));
  background-size: 200%;
  animation: gradShift 4s linear infinite;
  padding: 16px 40px;
  display: flex; gap: 60px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
}
@keyframes gradShift { 0%,100%{background-position:0%} 50%{background-position:100%} }
.stat-item { text-align: center; }
.stat-num { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 900; }
.stat-label { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; opacity: 0.8; text-transform: uppercase; }

/* ===== SECTION TITLE ===== */
.section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; }
.section-eyebrow {
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.4em; color: var(--gold);
  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;
  display: block;
}
.section-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
  font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1;
}
.section-line {
  width: 60px; height: 3px;
  background: var(--gold); margin: 16px auto 0;
  border-radius: 2px;
}

/* ===== WHY US ===== */
#why {
  padding: 100px 40px;
  background: var(--dark2);
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
#why::before {
  content:'';
  position: absolute; top: -200px; right: -200px;
  width: 600px; height: 600px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(240,165,0,0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.why-grid {
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
  gap: 32px;
}
.why-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.12);
  border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px 28px;
  text-align: center;
  transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
}
.why-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  border-color: rgba(240,165,0,0.4);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
}
.why-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.why-card h3 { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--gold); }
.why-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height: 1.7; }

/* ===== MENU TABS ===== */
#menu {
  padding: 100px 20px;
  background: var(--dark);
  position: relative;
}
.menu-tabs {
  display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
}
.tab-btn {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 50px; cursor: pointer;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: all 0.3s;
}
.tab-btn:hover, .tab-btn.active {
  background: var(--red);
  border-color: var(--red);
  color: white;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(200,16,46,0.4);
}

.menu-panel { display: none; }
.menu-panel.active { display: block; }

/* Size selector (pizza tabs) */
.size-tabs {
  display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.size-tab {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); padding: 7px 18px; border-radius: 50px;
  font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
}
.size-tab.active { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--dark); }

/* Pizza Cards */
.pizza-grid {
  max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
}
.pizza-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  position: relative;
}
.pizza-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  border-color: rgba(240,165,0,0.4);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}
.pizza-card-img {
  width: 100%; height: 190px; object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform 0.5s;
}
.pizza-card:hover .pizza-card-img { transform: scale(1.08); }
.pizza-img-wrap { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
.veg-badge, .nonveg-badge {
  position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 12px;
  padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}
.veg-badge { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.9); color: white; }
.nonveg-badge { background: rgba(220,38,38,0.9); color: white; }

.pizza-card-body { padding: 20px; }
.pizza-card-name {
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.pizza-card-desc {
  font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.pizza-card-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.pizza-price { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--gold); }
.pizza-price small { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--gray); display: block; }
.add-btn {
  background: var(--red); color: white; border: none;
  padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.add-btn:hover { background: #a00e26; transform: scale(1.05); }

/* Extras section cards */
.extras-grid {
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
}
.extras-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  transition: all 0.3s; cursor: pointer;
}
.extras-card:hover {
  border-color: rgba(240,165,0,0.3);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}
.extras-name { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.extras-sub { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gray); }
.extras-price { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.2rem; }

/* Category headers */
.cat-header {
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto 24px;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.2);
  padding-bottom: 10px;
}
.cat-section { margin-bottom: 50px; }

/* Momos table */
.momos-table-wrap { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
.momos-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
.momos-table th {
  font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); padding: 12px 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.2); text-align: center;
}
.momos-table td {
  padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  text-align: center;
}
.momos-table td:first-child { text-align: left; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; }
.momos-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }

/* ===== PIZZA MODAL ===== */
.modal-overlay {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2000;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  padding: 20px;
}
.modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
.modal-box {
  background: #1a1008; border: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.2);
  border-radius: 24px; max-width: 900px; width: 100%;
  max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto;
  animation: modalIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);
}
@keyframes modalIn { from { opacity:0; transform:scale(0.92) translateY(20px); } to { opacity:1; transform:scale(1) translateY(0); } }
.modal-img { width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0; }
.modal-body { padding: 36px; }
.modal-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.modal-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.modal-badge.veg { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.15); color: #4ade80; border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3); }
.modal-badge.nonveg { background: rgba(220,38,38,0.15); color: #f87171; border: 1px solid rgba(220,38,38,0.3); }

.modal-section-title { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
.modal-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); line-height: 1.8; }
.ingredient-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.ingredient-chip {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
}
.modal-size-btns { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 12px; }
.modal-size-btn {
  flex: 1; min-width: 120px; padding: 16px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
  text-align: center;
}
.modal-size-btn:hover, .modal-size-btn.selected {
  border-color: var(--gold); background: rgba(240,165,0,0.1);
}
.modal-size-label { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: white; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.modal-size-price { font-family: 'Playfair Display',serif; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.2rem; }
.modal-footer { margin-top: 32px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.modal-add-btn {
  flex: 1; background: var(--red); color: white; border: none;
  padding: 16px; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer;
  font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.modal-add-btn:hover { background: #a00e26; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(200,16,46,0.5); }
.modal-close {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); color: white; border: none;
  width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 20px; transition: all 0.2s;
}
.modal-close:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

/* ===== CART SIDEBAR ===== */
.cart-sidebar {
  position: fixed; inset-y: 0; right: 0; width: 380px; max-width: 100vw;
  background: #0f0a05; border-left: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.15);
  z-index: 1500; transform: translateX(100%);
  transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
}
.cart-sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }
.cart-header { padding: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.cart-header h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display',serif; font-size: 1.5rem; }
.cart-close { background: none; border: none; color: white; font-size: 28px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0.6; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
.cart-close:hover { opacity: 1; }
.cart-items { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
.cart-empty { text-align: center; padding: 80px 20px; opacity: 0.4; }
.cart-empty i { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; display: block; }
.cart-empty span { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
.cart-item {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
}
.cart-item-name { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
.cart-item-size { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 2px; }
.cart-item-price { font-family: 'Playfair Display',serif; color: var(--gold); }
.cart-item-remove { background: none; border: none; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); cursor: pointer; margin-left: 12px; transition: color 0.2s; }
.cart-item-remove:hover { color: var(--red); }
.cart-footer { padding: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
.cart-total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; align-items: center; }
.cart-total-label { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--gray); }
.cart-total-amount { font-family: 'Playfair Display',serif; font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--gold); }
.checkout-btn {
  width: 100%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366, #128C7E);
  color: white; border: none; padding: 18px;
  border-radius: 12px; font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif;
  font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; cursor: pointer;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
  transition: all 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(37,211,102,0.3);
}
.checkout-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(37,211,102,0.5); }

/* ===== ABOUT ===== */
#about {
  padding: 100px 40px;
  background: var(--dark2);
}
.about-wrap {
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center;
}
.about-img-wrap { position: relative; }
.about-img {
  width: 100%; border-radius: 20px; object-fit: cover; height: 450px;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}
.about-badge-float {
  position: absolute; bottom: -20px; right: -20px;
  background: var(--red); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px;
  text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(200,16,46,0.4);
}
.about-badge-num { font-family: 'Playfair Display',serif; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 900; }
.about-badge-text { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.25em; opacity: 0.85; }
.about-text p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.about-features { margin-top: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.about-feature { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
.about-feature-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(240,165,0,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.about-feature-text { font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }

/* ===== GALLERY ===== */
#gallery { padding: 100px 20px; background: var(--dark); }
.gallery-grid {
  max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 260px);
  gap: 12px;
}
.gallery-item { overflow: hidden; border-radius: 12px; position: relative; }
.gallery-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.5s; }
.gallery-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.08); }
.gallery-item:first-child { grid-row: span 2; }
.gallery-overlay {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,6,2,0.7) 0%, transparent 50%);
  opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;
  display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 20px;
}
.gallery-item:hover .gallery-overlay { opacity: 1; }
.gallery-overlay-text { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

/* ===== CONTACT ===== */
#contact { padding: 100px 40px; background: var(--dark2); }
.contact-wrap { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; }
.contact-info h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display',serif; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 30px; }
.contact-item { display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 28px; }
.contact-icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(240,165,0,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.contact-text label { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--gray); text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.contact-text a, .contact-text p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.contact-text a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

.contact-map-wrap { border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
.contact-map-wrap iframe { width: 100%; height: 350px; border: none; filter: invert(0.9) hue-rotate(180deg); }

/* ===== FOOTER ===== */
footer {
  background: #0a0602;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.1);
  padding: 60px 40px 30px;
}
.footer-wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
.footer-brand img { height: 70px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.footer-brand p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); line-height: 1.8; }
.footer-links h4 { font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.footer-links ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.footer-links a { font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding-top: 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
.footer-copy { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-family: 'Oswald',sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
.footer-social { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
.social-btn { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; }
.social-btn:hover { background: var(--gold); color: var(--dark); }

/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .nav-links { display: none; }
  .hamburger { display: block; }
  nav.mobile-open .nav-links {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: fixed;
    top: 70px; left: 0; right: 0; background: rgba(10,6,2,0.98);
    padding: 30px; gap: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,165,0,0.1);
  }
  .about-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .contact-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto; }
  .gallery-item:first-child { grid-row: auto; }
  .footer-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .modal-box { border-radius: 16px; }
  .cart-sidebar { width: 100%; }
  .hero-logo { height: 110px; }
  .stats-banner { gap: 30px; padding: 16px 20px; }
}

/* ===== SCROLL REVEAL ===== */
.reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }
.reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- INTRO SCREEN -->
<div id="intro-screen">
  <div class="intro-scene">
    <!-- Steam lines above oven -->
    <div class="steam-line"></div>
    <div class="steam-line"></div>
    <div class="steam-line"></div>
    <div class="steam-line"></div>

    <!-- PIZZA SVG (slides out from oven) -->
    <svg id="pizza-svg" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <!-- Pizza peel (wooden paddle) underneath -->
      <rect x="60" y="155" width="80" height="14" rx="4" fill="#8B5E2A" opacity="0.9"/>
      <rect x="88" y="168" width="24" height="50" rx="5" fill="#7A4E1C"/>
      <!-- Pizza crust (outer ring) -->
      <circle cx="100" cy="108" r="82" fill="#D4884A"/>
      <circle cx="100" cy="108" r="72" fill="#E8A44E"/>
      <!-- Sauce base -->
      <circle cx="100" cy="108" r="65" fill="#C0392B"/>
      <!-- Cheese layer -->
      <ellipse cx="100" cy="108" rx="58" ry="55" fill="#F5D76E" opacity="0.9"/>
      <!-- Cheese bubbles / melt patches -->
      <ellipse cx="85" cy="95" rx="22" ry="18" fill="#F0C84A" opacity="0.7"/>
      <ellipse cx="118" cy="120" rx="18" ry="14" fill="#F0C84A" opacity="0.7"/>
      <ellipse cx="95" cy="128" rx="20" ry="12" fill="#EEDDA0" opacity="0.5"/>
      <!-- Tomato slices (red) -->
      <circle cx="90" cy="90" r="10" fill="#E74C3C"/>
      <circle cx="88" cy="90" r="5" fill="#C0392B" opacity="0.5"/>
      <circle cx="116" cy="95" r="9" fill="#E74C3C"/>
      <circle cx="100" cy="118" r="10" fill="#E74C3C"/>
      <circle cx="80" cy="115" r="8" fill="#C74B3C"/>
      <circle cx="118" cy="118" r="8" fill="#E74C3C"/>
      <!-- Pepperoni (darker circles) -->
      <circle cx="107" cy="93" r="7" fill="#8B1A1A"/>
      <circle cx="91" cy="110" r="7" fill="#8B1A1A"/>
      <circle cx="108" cy="110" r="6" fill="#922020"/>
      <!-- Olive (black) -->
      <ellipse cx="83" cy="100" rx="5" ry="6" fill="#2C2C2C"/>
      <ellipse cx="115" cy="108" rx="4" ry="5" fill="#2C2C2C"/>
      <!-- Basil leaves (green) -->
      <ellipse cx="97" cy="100" rx="6" ry="4" fill="#27AE60" transform="rotate(-20 97 100)"/>
      <ellipse cx="110" cy="123" rx="5" ry="3" fill="#2ECC71" transform="rotate(15 110 123)"/>
      <!-- Crust highlight -->
      <circle cx="100" cy="108" r="82" fill="none" stroke="#C47A3A" stroke-width="4" opacity="0.6"/>
      <!-- Hot shine on top -->
      <ellipse cx="78" cy="84" rx="12" ry="6" fill="white" opacity="0.1" transform="rotate(-30 78 84)"/>
    </svg>

    <!-- OVEN SVG -->
    <svg id="oven-svg" viewBox="0 0 360 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <radialGradient id="ovenGlowGrad" cx="50%" cy="100%" r="70%">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#FF6B00" stop-opacity="0.8"/>
          <stop offset="60%" stop-color="#FF3300" stop-opacity="0.3"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#000" stop-opacity="0"/>
        </radialGradient>
        <linearGradient id="ovenBodyGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#3D2200"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1A0E00"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id="metalGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4a2800"/>
          <stop offset="40%" stop-color="#7a4a1a"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#3a1e00"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <filter id="glow">
          <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="4" result="coloredBlur"/>
          <feMerge><feMergeNode in="coloredBlur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge>
        </filter>
      </defs>

      <!-- Oven body -->
      <rect x="20" y="40" width="320" height="200" rx="18" fill="url(#ovenBodyGrad)" stroke="#5a3000" stroke-width="3"/>
      <!-- Metal top edge -->
      <rect x="20" y="40" width="320" height="28" rx="18" fill="url(#metalGrad)" opacity="0.8"/>
      <!-- Control panel top -->
      <circle cx="60" cy="54" r="8" fill="#1a0e00" stroke="#8B5E2A" stroke-width="2"/>
      <circle cx="60" cy="54" r="4" fill="#FF6B00" opacity="0.9"/>
      <circle cx="300" cy="54" r="8" fill="#1a0e00" stroke="#8B5E2A" stroke-width="2"/>
      <circle cx="300" cy="54" r="4" fill="#FF6B00" opacity="0.9"/>
      <rect x="140" y="48" width="80" height="12" rx="4" fill="#1a0e00" stroke="#5a3000" stroke-width="1.5"/>

      <!-- Oven door (main opening) - dark interior -->
      <rect x="55" y="75" width="250" height="150" rx="12" fill="#0D0700" stroke="#6B3F0A" stroke-width="3"/>

      <!-- Interior fire glow -->
      <ellipse cx="180" cy="200" rx="130" ry="40" fill="url(#ovenGlowGrad)" id="oven-glow"/>
      <!-- Flame colors inside -->
      <ellipse cx="180" cy="215" rx="80" ry="18" fill="#FF4500" opacity="0.35" style="animation: fireflicker2 0.35s infinite alternate;"/>
      <ellipse cx="180" cy="215" rx="50" ry="10" fill="#FF8C00" opacity="0.3" style="animation: fireflicker2 0.25s infinite alternate-reverse;"/>

      <!-- Door frame / trim -->
      <rect x="55" y="75" width="250" height="150" rx="12" fill="none" stroke="#8B5E2A" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.7"/>

      <!-- Bottom shelf rack lines inside oven -->
      <line x1="70" y1="195" x2="295" y2="195" stroke="#3a2000" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.6"/>
      <line x1="70" y1="185" x2="295" y2="185" stroke="#3a2000" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.4"/>

      <!-- Oven door handle bar -->
      <rect x="100" y="232" width="160" height="10" rx="5" fill="url(#metalGrad)" stroke="#8B5E2A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <!-- Handle grips -->
      <rect x="105" y="230" width="20" height="14" rx="4" fill="#5a3000"/>
      <rect x="235" y="230" width="20" height="14" rx="4" fill="#5a3000"/>

      <!-- Bottom base of oven -->
      <rect x="40" y="238" width="280" height="18" rx="6" fill="#2a1600" stroke="#5a3000" stroke-width="2"/>
      <!-- Feet -->
      <rect x="60" y="252" width="30" height="10" rx="3" fill="#1a0e00"/>
      <rect x="270" y="252" width="30" height="10" rx="3" fill="#1a0e00"/>

      <!-- Side vents -->
      <rect x="25" y="120" width="18" height="3" rx="1" fill="#5a3000" opacity="0.6"/>
      <rect x="25" y="128" width="18" height="3" rx="1" fill="#5a3000" opacity="0.6"/>
      <rect x="25" y="136" width="18" height="3" rx="1" fill="#5a3000" opacity="0.6"/>
      <rect x="317" y="120" width="18" height="3" rx="1" fill="#5a3000" opacity="0.6"/>
      <rect x="317" y="128" width="18" height="3" rx="1" fill="#5a3000" opacity="0.6"/>
      <rect x="317" y="136" width="18" height="3" rx="1" fill="#5a3000" opacity="0.6"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- Logo appears after pizza slides out -->
  <div class="intro-logo">
    <img src="logo.png" alt="Pizzoo">
    <div class="intro-tagline">Bhandup West · Mumbai · Est. 2024</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
@keyframes fireflicker2 {
  from { opacity: 0.25; transform: scaleX(0.92); }
  to   { opacity: 0.45; transform: scaleX(1.08); }
}
</style>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav id="navbar">
  <div class="nav-logo">
    <img src="logo.png" alt="Pizzoo" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/120x50?text=PIZZOO'">
  </div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#menu">Menu</a></li>
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="nav-actions">
    <button class="cart-btn" onclick="toggleCart()">
      <i class="fas fa-basket-shopping"></i>
      <span class="cart-badge" id="cart-count">0</span>
    </button>
    <a href="https://wa.me/917738009029" target="_blank" class="wa-btn">
      <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Order Now
    </a>
    <button class="hamburger" onclick="toggleMobileNav()"><i class="fas fa-bars"></i></button>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="home">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-badge">🍕 Fresh · Handcrafted · Premium</div>
    <img src="logo.png" class="hero-logo" alt="Pizzoo" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/250x160?text=PIZZOO'">
    <h1 class="hero-h1">
      The Art of <span>Italian Pizza</span><br>in Mumbai
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Authentic Italian pizza crafted with premium quality cheese & fresh ingredients.<br>No quality compromise. Ever.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="#menu" class="btn-primary">Explore Menu</a>
      <a href="tel:7738009029" class="btn-outline"><i class="fas fa-phone"></i> Call Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">
    <span>Scroll</span>
    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS -->
<div class="stats-banner">
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">32+</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Menu Items</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">100%</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Fresh Ingredients</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">3</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Pizza Sizes</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">⭐ 4.8</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Customer Rating</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- WHY US -->
<section id="why">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <span class="section-eyebrow">Why Choose Us</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">The Pizzoo Difference</h2>
    <div class="section-line"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="why-grid">
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon">🌾</div>
      <h3>Authentic Italian Base</h3>
      <p>Our pizza dough is made fresh daily using a traditional Italian recipe — light, crispy & perfectly chewy in every bite.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon">🧀</div>
      <h3>Premium Quality Cheese</h3>
      <p>Real mozzarella, no compromise. Generous portions of premium cheese that stretches perfectly with every bite.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon">🍅</div>
      <h3>Fresh Ingredients Daily</h3>
      <p>Vegetables, toppings and sauces are sourced fresh every day. No frozen shortcuts. Farm-to-pizza freshness in every slice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon">🛵</div>
      <h3>Fast Delivery</h3>
      <p>Hot pizza delivered to your doorstep in Bhandup West. Order via WhatsApp or call us directly for quick service.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MENU -->
<section id="menu">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Menu</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">What We Serve</h2>
    <div class="section-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="menu-tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('veg-pizza')">🍕 Veg Pizza</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('nonveg-pizza')">🍗 Non-Veg Pizza</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('burgers')">🍔 Burgers</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('fries')">🍟 Fries</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('momos')">🥟 Momos</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('more')">🥖 More</button>
  </div>

  <!-- VEG PIZZA TAB -->
  <div class="menu-panel active" id="tab-veg-pizza">
    <div class="size-tabs" style="margin-bottom:40px;">
      <button class="size-tab active" onclick="switchSize(this,'reg')">Regular</button>
      <button class="size-tab" onclick="switchSize(this,'med')">Medium</button>
      <button class="size-tab" onclick="switchSize(this,'lrg')">Large</button>
    </div>
