<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="about-wrap">
    <div class="about-img-wrap reveal">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571997478779-2adcbbe9ab2f?w=700" alt="Pizza Making" class="about-img">
      <div class="about-badge-float">
        <div class="about-badge-num">100%</div>
        <div class="about-badge-text">Fresh Dough<br>Daily</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text reveal">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px;">Crafting Pizza<br>the Right Way</h2>
      <p>At Pizzoo, we believe great pizza starts with great dough. That's why we use 00 high-protein wheat flour — the gold standard in Italian pizza-making — to create a base that's crispy on the outside, pillowy inside, and full of character.</p>
      <p>Located in the heart of Bhandup West, Mumbai, we serve authentic Italian-inspired pizzas with a menu that includes veg, non-veg, burgers, fries, momos, and more — all made fresh to order.</p>
      <div class="about-features">
        <div class="about-feature">
          <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-wheat-awn"></i></div>
          <div class="about-feature-text">00-grade flour from certified mills — higher protein for better gluten structure and authentic texture.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-feature">
          <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-fire-flame-curved"></i></div>
          <div class="about-feature-text">Hand-stretched dough baked at high temperature for the perfect leopard-spotted crust.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-feature">
          <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i></div>
          <div class="about-feature-text">No preservatives. No compromises. Fresh ingredients sourced daily from local markets.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-feature">
          <div class="about-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-award"></i></div>
          <div class="about-feature-text">Available on Zomato & Swiggy. Also order directly on WhatsApp for faster service!</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

